    "body": "I think we pretty much have to expose a way to set \"user interacted\". But that also means we need some kind of opt-in for setting that unless we're okay with existing form-associated custom elements never matching `:user-valid` and `:user-invalid`. Maybe we are?\r\n\r\ncc @mfreed7 @smaug---- @emilio ",
